WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:17.368
Caching is a byte-exact prefix match over tools, system, and messages: keep the prefix frozen, put breakpoints at the end of the shared part, choose the lifetime from real gaps, and verify with the usage fields after every change to prompt assembly.

3
00:00:17.648 --> 00:00:21.467
Send work nobody waits on through batch, keyed by custom_id.

4
00:00:21.747 --> 00:00:27.741
Treat effort as a measured trade, and before you build a router, measure the strongest model at lower effort.

5
00:00:28.021 --> 00:00:30.432
The next lesson turns from dollars to seconds.
